hamsterdan-operator
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of the Hamsterdan operator tooling
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/hamsterdan), pinned under
upstream/hamsterdan. It follows the behavior of src/hamsterdan/operator.py
and src/hamsterdan/host/publication_qualification.py, and its test suite
ports the upstream tests in tests/unit/test_operator.py,
tests/unit/host/test_publication_qualification.py,
tests/unit/host/test_secret_launch.py,
tests/integration/host/test_qualification_setup_local.py and
deployment/tests/test_container_contract.py.

The repository files scripts/with-runtime-secrets, deployment/config/* and
deployment/pi/* are unmodified copies of the upstream files of the same
names, and deployment/Containerfile is adapted from upstream's.

